## ☀️ BellevueWeather Flow (rebuilt)

**File:** `BellevueWeather/BellevueWeather/BellevueWeather.flow`

### Logic

| Node | What it does |
|---|---|
| **Manual Trigger** | Start the flow |
| **Get Weather** | HTTP GET to Open-Meteo — no connector, no API key. Fetches `current_weather` for Bellevue, WA in **°F** |
| **Check Temperature** | Script — reads `body.current_weather.temperature`, checks `> 60°F` |
| **Nice Day?** | Decision — `true` if temp > 60, `false` if ≤ 60 |
| **End** (true branch) | Outputs `"nice day"` |
| **End** (false branch) | Outputs `"bring a jacket"` |

